erial-box entry-material-text\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\\\"name\\\"\u003e这本小说真厉害！\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\",\"switch\":false,\"is_show_switch\":false,\"without_border\":false}\n","style":""}],"id":"3882","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"NPC对话","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"interactive_dialogue","layout":"","data":"{\"root_id\":\"\",\"child_ids\":null,\"contents\":null,\"list\":[{\"contents\":{\"4cf2vhylew3T1710863944349\":{\"icon\":\"\",\"option\":\"【再见】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cp\u003e您慢走，有什么生意还请照顾一下我们飞云商会。\u003c/p\u003e\"},\"8gfxrw8wla9T1710863939170\":{\"icon\":\"\",\"option\":\"【开场白】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e少爷又跑到哪儿去了呢，唉…\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e啊，不好意思，几位老爷来飞云商会有何贵干？\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e【第二次海灯节（2022）期间】\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e听说少爷在海灯节期间接手了不少工作应该还顺利吧…\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e不过还是跟平常一样，人影也不见一个…\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\"},\"nqb471m7nmnT1710863941173\":{\"icon\":\"\",\"option\":\"【老爷…？】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e没错，是称呼您。我这做下人已经习惯了，毕竟飞云商会进进出出的十有八九都是大老板，嘿嘿。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e而且我们家少爷也嘱咐过，做生意一定要学着对谁都客气…\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e以貌取人的话，没准哪天就会惹上大人物。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e这也是飞云商会一向遵循的商道吧，哈哈。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\"},\"z2tn3pzsbujT1710863943430\":{\"icon\":\"\",\"option\":\"【少爷⋯？】\",\"dialogue\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e您是听到我刚才念叨少爷了吧。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e飞云商会现在很多生意都交给少爷在打理，包括最重要的丝绸买卖。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e可少爷虽然在经商方面天赋异禀，可心思却总不在这边，是不是就突然没了人影。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e而厉害的就在于…不仅没影响了生意，这几年还越做越红火。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e老爷也那他没办法，或者说是找不到责备的理由吧…\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e唉，真搞不懂…\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\"}},\"root_id\":\"8gfxrw8wla9T1710863939170\",\"child_ids\":{\"4cf2vhylew3T1710863944349\":[],\"8gfxrw8wla9T1710863939170\":[\"nqb471m7nmnT1710863941173\",\"z2tn3pzsbujT1710863943430\",\"4cf2vhylew3T1710863944349\"],\"nqb471m7nmnT1710863941173\":[],\"z2tn3pzsbujT1710863943430\":[]}}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"3885","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false}],"filter_values":{},"menu_id":"0","menu_name":"","version":"1746586856","langs":[],"template_layout":{"tab":[{"tab_id":"69","tab_name":"页签1","module_group":[{"module_group_id":"691","layout":"l2r1","module":[{"id":"1207","pos":"left"},{"id":"1208","pos":"right"},{"id":"3882","pos":"banner"}],"name":"基本资料","repeated":false,"parent_group_id":"0"},{"module_group_id":"692","layout":"l1r1","module":[{"id":"1209","pos":"banner"}],"name":"","repeated":true,"parent_group_id":"0"},{"module_group_id":"693","layout":"l1r1","module":[{"id":"1210","pos":"banner"},{"id":"3885","pos":"banner"}],"name":"","repeated":false,"parent_group_id":"0"},{"module_group_id":"694","layout":"l2r1","module":[{"id":"1211","pos":"left"},{"id":"1212","pos":"right"}],"name":"","repea